id: pm-rust-rnex
title: Install the published-CLI oracle from a committed lockfile in CI
description: "CI installs the conformance oracle with npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@<pin> and npm exec --package=..., pinning only the top-level package. The CLI ships no shrinkwrap (unbraind/pm-cli#1417), so a partially propagated OpenTelemetry 2.12.0 release failed all six runners in run 37472610207 (pm-rust-otel). Commit tests/oracle/package.json + package-lock.json, install with npm ci --prefix tests/oracle on Linux/macOS/Windows, point PM_NODE_CLI and the merge-driver/health steps at that install, update tests/release_pipeline_contract.rs pins, and let Dependabot (npm, /tests/oracle) bump it. Raised by CodeRabbit on PR #60 (comment 4200300693, zizmor adhoc-packages)."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,reproducibility,upstream
created_at: "2026-10-06T20:51:26.186Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T18:39:15.279Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-07T18:39:14.350Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-07T18:39:14.350Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: Every CI job installs the oracle via npm ci from a committed lockfile; zizmor reports no adhoc-packages; release_pipeline_contract pins the lockfile path; all six checks green
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-07T15:59:42.003Z",codex-sol,"Use tests/oracle/package.json with an exact 2026.10.7 dependency and a committed npm lockfile. Share npm ci installation and executable selection between local parity, CI health, and merge-driver setup; add release pipeline contract coverage."
  "2026-10-07T16:07:29.565Z",codex-sol,Oracle install succeeds via npm ci --prefix tests/oracle --ignore-scripts. The manifest and lock both pin 2026.10.7 with a registry tarball integrity; runtime dependencies ship bundled in that immutable artifact. CI resolves PM_NODE_CLI with Node path.resolve for Windows portability and uses the same entry for health and merge install. Zizmor 1.30.1 reports no findings for ci.yml (three existing suppressions); 18 pipeline contract tests pass.
  "2026-10-07T16:18:30.987Z",codex-sol,"Final complete Linux release gate and the 18 release pipeline contract tests pass. Both ordinary and nightly parity use the required lockfile oracle. Zizmor reports no ci.yml findings, and strict check-only health with merge drivers passes with three existing advisory classes. Follow-up pm-rust-vuwe owns those advisories. Local verification covers Linux; the PR matrix will provide macOS and Windows evidence. Changelog regeneration succeeds. Leave this item in progress for orchestrator verification and release the claim."
