close_reason: "Merged in #65 (bb9d404). The published-CLI parity oracle is an exact @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.7 dependency in tests/oracle with a committed package-lock.json, installed with npm ci (just oracle-install) by local release checks and CI, so its transitive tree is reproducible (pm-cli#1417). CodeRabbit full review at 6c87a3e: no actionable comments."
